config R8169
	tristate "Realtek RTL8111/8168 and RTL8125 PCIe Ethernet"
	default y
	help
	  Native driver for supported Realtek RTL8111/8168 Gigabit and RTL8125
	  2.5 Gigabit PCIe Ethernet MAC revisions. Supports coherent DMA and
	  standard copper autonegotiation, with software protocol checksums.
	  Select M to build r8169.ko. The default configuration builds it in.
